{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_1_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Akitoshi decided to take a vacation on Earth to rest and recover from the drudge of office life. Everything was perfect... Until a sudden storm sank the ship he was on! Now he's been washed ashore on a random island in the middle of who knows where, attacked by a wild animal, and saved by a mysterious woman. What will happen to him now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_2_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know your savior, investigate the island... Do whatever you have to in order to survive and escape this tropical nightmare in this island exploration adventure RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_3_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_01_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_02_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_4_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate the Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's a secret hidden here, and you'll need to leave no stone unturned in order to uncover it... perhaps learning more about the enigmatic Mayalala in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a wide array of expertly drawn character art as you take in the gorgeous island scenery. With sights like these, maybe this can still be a vacation to remember!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Different Endings to Uncover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no shortage of dangers on the island... Can you brave them and live long enough to find your way back to your home planet?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421080?t=1753237164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421080?t=1753237164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/904abd7117e286c6ad0582b9c244390cedacf3f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753237164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/904abd7117e286c6ad0582b9c244390cedacf3f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753237164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421080/extras/Island_Life_With_Mayalala_Description_1_EN.png?t=1753237164\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Akitoshi decided to take a vacation on Earth to rest and recover from the drudge of office life. Everything was perfect... Until a sudden storm sank the ship he was on! Now he's been washed ashore on a random island in the middle of 